WEBVTT

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.070
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:33.880
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.180
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.020
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.720
With you guys

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.720
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.390
If we join forces

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.360
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.700
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:02.870
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:09.010
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.080
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.020
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:17.150
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:22.320
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.330
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.030
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:33.070
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:35.940
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:39.940
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.140
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:49.880
Someone once said...

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:55.520
There is escargot like marbled wagyu 
beef with magnificent horns...

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:02.400
Escowgot!

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:08.970
There are bugs that stock up on forest 
fruit and turn it into first-rate jam...

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:12.510
Jambugs!

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:16.740
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:21.620
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:27.920
Toriko and Komatsu accepted 
a request from Setsuno

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:31.930
and headed out to capture Golden Wheat, 
an ingredient in her All-Noodles.

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:30.460
Gastro Gig

00:02:33.030 --> 00:02:36.460
Just when they thought capturing 
the wheat would be a breeze,

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:40.070
a new type of GT Robot 
controlled by Yuu appeared.

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:47.110
Gourmet Corp's Yuu was after an Infinibee, 
a bee that leads to Acacia's menu.

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:53.250
Toriko waged a fierce 
battle with the GT Robot.

00:02:58.350 --> 00:03:04.890
Showing His True Ability! A Taste of Komatsu's 
Honoring the Food! The "Phantom Noodles", All-Noodles!

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:08.130
Telexistence mode...

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:09.960
...boost!

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:13.930
I'm going to let loose, Toriko!

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:16.640
Anytime you're ready!

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:19.800
I'll turn your prized "new 
type" into scrap metal!

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:22.970
I'll show you...

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:24.240
...Honoring the Food!

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:30.580
You won't beat this machine.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:37.920
Essentially, GT Robots directly 
receive the power of their operator.

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:44.060
They replicate the operator's 
movements and power perfectly.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:45.460
However...

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:48.800
...this body is set to be mass-produced.

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:50.130
Mass-produced?

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:53.570
No matter who controls 
it, they have to be able

00:03:53.570 --> 00:03:56.270
to maneuver it in a harsh environment.

00:03:56.610 --> 00:04:03.680
Therefore, it's been designed to triple 
the operator's power and speed.

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:09.590
Are you prepared,

00:04:09.590 --> 00:04:10.920
Gourmet Hunter Toriko?!

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:14.460
I've heard enough about your toy. 
Bring it on whenever you're ready!

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:24.370
You stopped me...

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:52.290
It's like you're totally 
different than before.

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:54.560
Don't tell me you were saving up power?

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:56.800
How?!

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:01.900
That's...

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:05.340
I see. You were trying to avoid 
getting your partner involved.

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:09.010
Certainly, when Komatsu was 
here, I held back some,

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:10.810
but don't get the wrong idea.

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:14.250
Even now, I'm not goin' all out.

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:15.220
What?!

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:17.820
If both of us collide at full power,

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:21.120
there's a chance the rest of this 
Golden Wheat would be destroyed.

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:23.560
And that's why you're dialing it down?

00:05:23.560 --> 00:05:26.760
How rude of you to say that, 
Gourmet Hunter Toriko!

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:30.700
W-What is this?!

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:34.170
Joe Joe, what's the meaning of this?!

00:05:34.470 --> 00:05:36.300
What in the world...?!

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:39.170
Energy output unstable?

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:41.610
Should never have put it in boost mode!

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:44.110
So at the end of the day, 
it's just a prototype...

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:45.550
However,

00:05:45.550 --> 00:05:47.650
I haven't achieved my objective.

00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:50.220
I can't go back home with 
my tail between my legs.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:52.090
There must be some way...

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:54.250
That's...

00:05:54.590 --> 00:05:56.790
It looks like your toy's hit its limit.

00:05:58.190 --> 00:06:00.030
Why don't you just go home?

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:03.600
I can't afford to return empty-handed.

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:11.600
Stubborn bastard. Alright, then!

00:06:13.070 --> 00:06:13.970
Spiked Punch!

00:06:15.740 --> 00:06:17.880
I'll take that on with my right arm alone!

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:19.080
Separate!

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:24.950
Where is he?!

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:29.150
Komatsu!

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:32.060
Leg Knife!

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:35.960
He dodged it?!

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:37.460
No...

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:40.830
He was after that the whole time?!

00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:42.730
Here we go.

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:47.210
So the Infinibee was attracted 
to the wheat that guy's carrying.

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.910
Even with all that wheat...

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:55.280
Come to think of it, with 
the Century Soup too...

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:58.080
His Food Luck attracted the soup...

00:06:58.080 --> 00:07:00.220
And now it attracted the Infinibee!

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:07.120
Are you okay?!

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:08.990
Y-Yeah...

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:11.060
What was that?

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:12.560
I dunno...

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:16.230
But it seems like they're up to no good.

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:19.500
Anyway, you sure got a lot.

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:20.070
Yep!

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:26.210
It'll regrow, won't it?

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:28.610
It'll be back to normal in no time.

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:31.550
As long as the sun keeps shining like this.

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:33.480
Toriko-san...

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:36.420
Did Setsuno-san ask us to come 
here to get the ingredient or...

00:07:36.420 --> 00:07:40.790
Yeah. She probably knew 
Gourmet Corp was coming.

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:45.030
What's that?! Gourmet Corp was there?!

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:47.400
You didn't know?!

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:51.100
I'm not the kind of person who 
plays crafty tricks like that.

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:53.140
I'm not Ichi-chan.

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:56.110
U-Um, in that case, getting the wheat

00:07:56.110 --> 00:07:58.670
was incredibly easy...

00:07:58.670 --> 00:08:00.810
Yes, I'm sure it was.

00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:02.180
The actual capture of it.

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:06.310
I asked you to help me.

00:08:06.310 --> 00:08:09.020
Not just capture it for me.

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:13.490
M-Me?!

00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:15.220
Make it by myself?!

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:19.090
It's in your hands. I'm 
busy with other things.

00:08:19.090 --> 00:08:21.660
B-But it's your noodles, Setsuno-san!

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:24.070
I can't do it! It's impossible!

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:25.230
Right, Toriko-san?

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:29.040
It'll be fine, Komatsu. All 
you have to do is relax.

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:34.810
You can do it if you listen carefully 
to the voice of the ingredients.

00:08:34.810 --> 00:08:38.380
And of course, I'll tell you how to make it.

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:39.480
The voice...

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:42.080
The voice of the ingredients?

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:48.690
Cutting the husks with a Melk knife...

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:56.400
Alright. This should be enough to crush.

00:08:57.400 --> 00:09:02.670
While separating the husks, 
you smooth out the wheat.

00:09:02.670 --> 00:09:05.970
The trick is to shake the Golden Wheat

00:09:05.970 --> 00:09:09.180
at a set rhythm of three times per second.

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:11.440
He's doing it naturally.

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:13.250
Very impressive.

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:15.820
Alright, water comes next.

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:17.680
Use this.

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:19.320
Air Aqua

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:19.320
Air Aqua?

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:21.820
Are you sure it's okay?!

00:09:21.820 --> 00:09:23.760
Use as much as you want.

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:25.290
Thank you!

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:31.200
Hey, you really aren't holdin' back!

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:33.100
Usin' that much'll drown it...

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:33.900
What?!

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:38.140
Even though you put in 100 liters, 
it absorbed all the water?!

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:43.540
That's because the rays of the 
sun make Golden Wheat bone-dry.

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:46.080
So it absorbs water.

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:48.150
Now it's nice and moist.

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:50.020
Now I have to knead it.

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:54.650
That feels great!

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:55.750
What?!

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:59.620
Golden Wheat is a Super Special 
Preparation Ingredient.

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:02.330
When you knead it, it makes a sound 
that's similar to a human voice.

00:10:02.630 --> 00:10:05.000
It sounded just like an old man's voice!

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:08.670
It's like a wee old man is in there... 
Or make that a <i>wheat</i> old man!

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:12.670
Yeah, that really hits the spot!

00:10:13.070 --> 00:10:16.870
Getting it to make a noise is no small feat.

00:10:16.870 --> 00:10:19.140
Except for Komatsu-kun...

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:21.880
I-Is this right?

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:25.380
Anyway, the key to making 
Golden Wheat taste good

00:10:25.380 --> 00:10:28.190
is by getting the dough to relax.

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:32.220
Knead it as if you were 
giving a gentle massage.

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:33.590
Right!

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:38.400
Yes, right there...

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:41.560
Now I'll try giving it something 
like a shoulder pounding.

00:10:41.560 --> 00:10:43.600
Bam-bam-bam-bam.

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:48.040
It sounds like the Golden Wheat is into it!

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:51.470
If you do a good job getting out 
the kinks, it'll sleep like a log.

00:10:51.470 --> 00:10:54.440
Sleeping All-Noodles are 
especially delicious!

00:10:57.780 --> 00:10:59.120
Yeah...

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:02.350
T-The voice has gotten 
younger! I mean, the sound...

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:06.160
That's proof the wheat has 
become supple and lustrous.

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:07.420
What's that?!

00:11:07.420 --> 00:11:09.630
Yeah, don't stop...

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:11.230
Right there!

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:12.830
It's become a woman's voice!

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:14.200
Yeah!

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:16.330
Now it's young again!

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:22.070
Three days to knead the noodles...

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:23.840
And at last...

00:11:24.170 --> 00:11:25.470
At last, I'm finished!

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:29.940
T-That's All-Noodles!

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:46.530
T-This is All-Noodles!

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:50.530
Incredible! It's as brilliant as the sun!

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:52.600
It looks like you're done.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:53.900
Let's see...

00:11:55.640 --> 00:11:56.800
It's so supple.

00:11:56.800 --> 00:12:00.640
And lustrous! It's like a baby's cheek.

00:12:00.640 --> 00:12:02.480
Well done.

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:04.040
Thank you.

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:06.010
And now...

00:12:06.010 --> 00:12:08.680
All-Noodles

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:08.680
I'm going to run the stand?!

00:12:09.180 --> 00:12:12.790
Just serve the All-Noodles to the customers.

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:17.890
Today, those "Phantom Noodles", 
All-Noodles, are available once more!

00:12:17.890 --> 00:12:21.460
Your gourmet newscaster, Tina, 
smelled a scoop and is on the scene!

00:12:21.460 --> 00:12:24.130
I'm totally gonna get a scoop 
on the All-Noodles today!

00:12:25.630 --> 00:12:28.000
And since Toriko's here, I'm here!

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:28.700
Rin-san!

00:12:29.300 --> 00:12:31.770
Let's hurry up and eat!

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:33.810
So, how do you eat it?

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:37.440
You can have whatever 
kind of noodles you like.

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:38.710
Right, Setsuno-san?

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:41.050
That's exactly right.

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:45.480
All-Noodles can become any kind of noodles,

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:47.750
depending how they're cut and boiled.

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:50.060
You can tell when you knead it.

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:52.890
Cut it thick and boil it well...

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:54.990
...and you get udon noodles!

00:12:55.860 --> 00:12:57.160
Delicious!

00:12:57.160 --> 00:12:59.030
This soft and sticky texture...

00:12:59.030 --> 00:13:02.130
The noodles are chewy, like 
they're totally relaxed!

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:05.000
If I cut the dough thin 
and prepare it just so...

00:13:05.270 --> 00:13:07.810
Here you go! Century Soup spaghetti!

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:13.040
The perfect amount of boiling 
to make it al dente!

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:15.610
It's got a rainbow and is super-delicious!

00:13:15.610 --> 00:13:17.780
It tickles this maiden's heart!

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:22.150
I'm still a maiden!

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:26.460
That's really pushin' it 
to call yourself a maiden.

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:27.990
Tom-san!

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:30.060
Hey, you're late!

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:32.960
What's with the face?

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:37.430
What's wrong? You were lookin' 
forward to the All-Noodles too!

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:39.500
The sorrows of a wholesale dealer.

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:42.970
There are good ingredients in Jiddal, 
so I went there on a buying mission.

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:45.980
You look tired.

00:13:45.980 --> 00:13:48.040
I've hardly gotten any sleep.

00:13:48.710 --> 00:13:51.880
And after this, I gotta set 
up shop at the marketplace.

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:54.180
At a time like this...

00:13:57.720 --> 00:14:00.120
Not Szechuan-style tantanmen but <i>sun</i>-tanmen!

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:02.490
That's the Golden Wheat's true ability!

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:04.260
It's bright like the sun!

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:10.200
Looks like a shockwave's 
runnin' through his body!

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:13.340
That's because I put in super-spicy 
chili peppers and <i>hot</i>-baneros!

00:14:13.340 --> 00:14:17.970
That's a Special Preparation Ingredient, 
because if you use the wrong amount,

00:14:17.970 --> 00:14:19.910
the person can't move for a year!

00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:22.480
Top of the morning!

00:14:22.480 --> 00:14:24.550
He gave a morning greeting 
without even meaning to!

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:27.780
Top of the morning!

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:30.190
And here come some customers!

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:31.590
Alright!

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:35.460
Special yakisoba fried in Mors Oil!

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:37.390
All-Noodles taste great fried too!

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:41.760
Light soy ramen!

00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:44.300
The egg noodles go great with the soup!

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:46.000
It goes down smoothly!

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:48.240
Next we'll do white noodles 
that go down the water slide!

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:49.770
Everybody get in line!

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:52.810
I'm not even getting a gram over here!

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:57.580
Thank you for the food!

00:14:58.310 --> 00:15:01.480
Toriko, you ate all the different 
kinds of All-Noodles!

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:03.950
That's because my favorite 
kind of noodles is all kinds!

00:15:03.950 --> 00:15:08.120
Even though we were eating All-Noodles, 
I didn't get even one gram on camera.

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:10.490
Komatsu-kun.

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:14.290
I enjoyed your original All-Noodles.

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:17.030
I learned a lot!

00:15:17.030 --> 00:15:19.870
I didn't teach you anything!

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:23.700
Your power is what made the All-Noodles.

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:28.740
You've met various people 
and have grown from it.

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:30.740
People that have touched your heart,

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:32.610
people that caused you pain...

00:15:33.150 --> 00:15:35.580
You've been through a lot, right?

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:39.350
And all of it makes you grow,

00:15:39.350 --> 00:15:42.020
without you even knowing it.

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:44.490
Be grateful for all of it.

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:45.530
Grateful...

00:15:45.830 --> 00:15:50.030
Like the All-Noodles, all of 
them are originally the same.

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:54.070
All of it becomes food 
of the soul for tomorrow.

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:55.330
Setsuno-san!

00:15:55.670 --> 00:15:58.740
Well, should we wind it up here?

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:01.240
I'm busy with other things.

00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:05.340
You keep saying you're busy, but 
you stuck around the whole time!

00:16:05.340 --> 00:16:06.210
Yeesh.

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:09.580
Oh, I almost forgot!

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:16.250
To make All-Noodles out of Super Special 
Preparation Ingredient, Golden Wheat

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:21.660
is just as difficult as it 
is to cook with Bubble Fruit.

00:16:22.490 --> 00:16:24.660
That funky cooking?!

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:29.030
I'm sure Komatsu-kun could 
cook with Bubble Fruit too.

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:31.200
I can say without any doubt that

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:33.970
your Honoring the Food is the real thing!

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:41.250
Thank you!

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.750
Good for you, Komatsu.

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:47.920
Toriko-san!

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:57.530
Sensei, you could've made the All-Noodles 
in three minutes, so why ask him?

00:16:57.530 --> 00:16:59.930
Good question.

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:03.500
By the by, how are you doing 
with your project, Nono?

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:04.970
I'm finished.

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:10.710
Just as you told me,

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:15.080
I freeze-dried 10 million cup noodles 
packed with ingredients for an emergency.

00:17:15.350 --> 00:17:17.310
Good work.

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:19.020
I see.

00:17:19.520 --> 00:17:21.150
Teppei!

00:17:21.150 --> 00:17:25.490
You closed the mobile food stands to 
use the All-Noodles for cup noodles.

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:30.190
The mobile food stands were fine,

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:32.760
but cup noodles can keep for a long time.

00:17:32.760 --> 00:17:34.600
And also,

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:37.670
they've finally learned Honoring the Food.

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:41.040
It's not only Toriko and Komatsu-kun.

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:51.510
I wouldn't if I were you.

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:54.720
My poison is more dangerous than ever now 
that I've mastered Honoring the Food.

00:17:56.580 --> 00:17:57.690
You want a little taste?

00:18:02.460 --> 00:18:03.990
Mushroses!

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:05.130
Beautiful...

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:08.660
You were about to stomp on them.

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:14.640
Delicious!

00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:17.000
If I didn't have my Honoring 
the Food-boosted Hair Lock...

00:18:21.010 --> 00:18:24.450
They must think they're safe in the air.

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:27.820
Not a care in the world...

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:33.920
Don't get cocky!

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:44.460
That wiped out hundreds of 
sea creatures on top of it.

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:51.040
Well, I guess that'll do for a light snack.

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:53.670
Don't tell me the other three Kings too...?

00:18:55.310 --> 00:18:58.610
This young generation is growing up.

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:03.180
So you encountered Toriko?

00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:04.280
Yes.

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:08.020
But the robot's power fell short, 
so I couldn't take him down...

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:09.560
However,

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:13.260
thanks to Yuu-sama, I 
got data from the robot,

00:19:13.260 --> 00:19:14.890
so I'll make modifications

00:19:15.260 --> 00:19:16.630
and next time for sure...

00:19:17.230 --> 00:19:19.400
Well, I can overlook this,

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:22.800
since the Infinibee was 
captured successfully.

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:30.610
Well, well, Special Cooking 
Adviser Girim-sama...

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:36.280
Infinibee...

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:40.820
Its wings make a fine sound.

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:44.220
Even now, it seems like it will fly away.

00:19:44.220 --> 00:19:45.890
Don't worry.

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:50.190
Until a detailed examination is complete, 
it will be kept under lock and key.

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:51.100
Good day to you.

00:20:09.210 --> 00:20:12.280
What is this sense of foreboding...?

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:15.950
Infinibee...

00:20:16.390 --> 00:20:18.460
Acacia's Special Menu...

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:21.690
And it will lead us to a hint, supposedly.

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:25.200
I don't know if it's true or not,

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:27.030
but...

00:20:36.070 --> 00:20:39.510
Maybe I'll ask them to get me something...

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:42.610
After all, there are a lot of 
suspicious goings-on these days.

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:06.230
I have been alone

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:13.640
Ever since that day

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:21.420
All I got was a definite history

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:28.020
But tomorrow is still, still, 
still just an uncertain dream

00:21:28.160 --> 00:21:31.760
It’s like a tautology, logy

00:21:31.960 --> 00:21:35.200
This is a tautology, logy

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:38.970
A dream is still a dream

00:21:39.130 --> 00:21:42.570
Not gonna wake up, logy, logy

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:46.370
Right now, we’re lookin’ at

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:49.910
What it is we're lookin' at

00:21:50.710 --> 00:21:57.420
The thing we’re lookin’ 
at ain’t no illusion

00:22:00.950 --> 00:22:03.920
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:04.390 --> 00:22:08.390
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:15.640
Hiding Level 25

00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:11.560
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is 25.

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:13.530
The allotted time limit is 15 seconds.

00:22:13.530 --> 00:22:15.640
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:18.140 --> 00:22:21.440
Food stands at night, and there's 
a heaping helping of people!

00:22:22.040 --> 00:22:25.110
And it looks like there's a 
heaping helping of yummy food...

00:22:25.480 --> 00:22:28.710
But where could Yun be?!

00:22:31.580 --> 00:22:34.150
Yun is... right here!

00:22:35.890 --> 00:22:38.820
Hiding among the masks, huh?

00:22:38.820 --> 00:22:42.430
You could say he was m-asking 
too much not to be noticed!

00:22:44.230 --> 00:22:45.000
Cold...

00:22:45.360 --> 00:22:46.360
Okay!

00:22:46.360 --> 00:22:49.730
Next time, at last, we charge into a new arc!

00:22:52.040 --> 00:22:54.570
Ominous footsteps from all four directions have the ground shaking...

00:22:54.570 --> 00:22:57.580
The countdown to human extinction has begun!

00:22:57.960 --> 00:23:01.880
The Four Kings Assemble! The Gourmet World Monsters, the Four-Beasts, Awaken!

00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:03.680
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
